      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grabill%2C_Indiana",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town hosts a branch of the Allen County Public Library, offering residents a quiet place to read.",
