      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grabill%2C_Indiana",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Grabill is known for its antique shops and nearby Amish farms, drawing visitors who love rural charm.",
